    "name": "XpertLink Expert Subscription Flow (Verified)",
    "description": "Real-world expert subscription lifecycle flow: registers a fresh expert, verifies OTP, completes onboarding, subscribes for the first time, tests re-subscribe guard (409), upgrades plan, cancels subscription (cancel-at-period-end), and verifies access is preserved until period end.",
